# A seven-day quarantine for newly published versions, ported from Helix
# 2026-09-25. `min-release-age` needs npm 11.10 or later: this machine's Node 22
# carries npm 11.19, and the bundled 10.9 ignores the key without a word. CI
# runs `npm ci`, which resolves nothing, so it needs no quarantine.
min-release-age=7
